{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6eb11f2538b559e630c6f793711058f14cc1af60479283e387988f8ed1ff01af", "ja": "踊ろう、笑顔になって！", "zh": "跳舞吧，露出笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cf91389897206c7ff727fa3a7b73ca94efd99be851be886ddcbaa47359257fe6", "ja": "公園でのレッスンにプロデューサーも立ち会\nうが、エレナと美奈子は物足りない様子。エ\nミリーと育の言葉にヒントを得て、最初に踊\nったサンバを取り入れることに。輝きを増す\nダンスに、手応えを感じるプロデューサー。", "zh": "制作人旁观大家在公园的练习，\n而艾琳娜和美奈子似乎不太满足。\n听了艾蜜莉和育的提示后，\n决定将一开始跳的森巴舞也加进去。\n越发闪亮的舞蹈让制作人也有了信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca5da57de2c32106ce38b55b4c0ba415eaee1ea4a37ad4e7efb958cf11e6c0d4", "ja": "（今日は気分を変えて、公園でレッスンだ）", "zh": "（为了转换心情，今天在公园练习。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8697eb3f5a193fc268d06812102b040861f39a89097290526e1105856ff6529c", "ja": "（翼とひなたは、また仲良く営業……。とりあえず、\n可奈、美奈子、エレナの3人で進めておこう）", "zh": "（翼和日向今天也手牵手去工作了……总之，\n先让可奈、美奈子、艾琳娜三个人开始练习吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "0df7398a55c1d7236759b7268de309d1bdb7f236e99a59bd2034bcd8d3adff59", "ja": "ちゃららら～ん、じゃ～ん♪", "zh": "锵啦啦啦～锵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "53be544343b9c2558a7c85bdb6c4962f1a895d1fb9a04d13cde852f9a7b0ffd0", "ja": "わぁっ、1曲通して踊れましたね♪\nどうでしたか、{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "哇，跳完整首歌了呢♪\n{$P$}先生，看起来怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8d37d4753d1de923314230b14ed2e2f28d12126e77718d0d157ecfb34430e65d", "ja": "そうだな。\nミスもなかったし、いい感じだったんじゃないか？", "zh": "这个嘛……\n没什么失误，感觉很棒不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "e5847c0eba627bf14a8be618a5c974bf2f597a611f7095a8750aa15b9f7f9b96", "ja": "わーい♪　美奈子さんとエレナさんが、\nいっぱい教えてくれたおかげですね！", "zh": "耶～♪多亏了美奈子和艾琳娜，\n她们指导了我好多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "895cd216b3994a39983311bc7e791241d5e8d66109892e8b2e8158acb4a02ce3", "ja": "ン～……。でも、ホントにいいのかナ？", "zh": "嗯……可是，这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "e7a4109780d64bae4e01d2efcd694e92db26a687f35128ab205fd9566dd08877", "ja": "えっ！？　やっぱりダメでした？？", "zh": "咦！？果然还是不行吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "da316e633e8057893f710acce49aac3041966495527ecb95da9deaf13d25c2c3", "ja": "ダメじゃなくて、何か足りない感じもするね？\nちょっぴり塩気が足りないっていうか……。", "zh": "也不是不行，只是觉得好像少了点什么。\n就像料理有点不够咸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ea7f366037fe702bc1b6a69eed620d877272aeb6c40706a9243e1af3fcddb69", "ja": "そうなノ。この曲なら、\nもっと楽しくダンスできるハズだヨ？", "zh": "对呀，这首曲子的话，\n应该能够跳得更开心才对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6bf170525a191a5b45aea7d0a5937f093fdc137aa8f106a3eccef930e687f583", "ja": "（ふむ……。今のみんなに、足りないもの、か）", "zh": "（嗯……现在的她们所缺少的东西吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "fa1df2224a9de53b07297eb59739cce3c2c4874dbfeac88e58f2679861c9d823", "ja": "みなさん、お疲れ様です。", "zh": "各位，你们辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "16578e697117cb9816d38ae308de03dd4aafa9c4f25160ecc2b7d9cf9a67794f", "ja": "おつかれさま！", "zh": "辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "614861dc563f653939a486b7844391742aa24245493bbd9959c927a0e8b3e31f", "ja": "あっ、エミリーちゃん、育ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，艾蜜莉、小育！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "81d9bb6c48eb1873d3c16e84205f8f2dbc5b7c77f466294105eaeccec30fcdd5", "ja": "日光律動に向けての稽古でお疲れのころかと\n思いましたので、差し入れを持ってまいりました。", "zh": "猜你们排练『阳光律动』应该正好累了，\n我们就带着慰劳品过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "c00e5c5fecaf30ad1659ef61b0842755ddb5f44d4e3bad7e07fb0d907c83c851", "ja": "おはぎと、お抹茶だよ！\nいっぱい持ってきたから、いっぱいたべてね！", "zh": "有萩饼和抹茶喔！\n我们带了很多来，多吃一点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "5ce1612b0448ab059dcf21f2012fe3f57c65bb2e437a01b1dfc1132b73e8a857", "ja": "わーい、ありがとう！\nえへへ、エネルギーエネルギー♪　いただきまーす！", "zh": "耶～谢谢你们！\n嘿嘿，补充能量补充能量♪我开动啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "ed19a2f741b33cc2ff73010800a8fbfda08ec9508072e63f3bc56977c9015483", "ja": "仕掛け人さまもどうぞ。\n甘いもので、疲れを癒してくださいね♪", "zh": "策划执行人先生也请用。\n吃些甜品疗愈疲惫的身心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "47bc78dc8bc41555fdce63088ca99068c88ff5909e1d683501d68612958c219c", "ja": "おお、ありがたくいただくよ。\nふたりとも、ありがとうな！", "zh": "嗯，那我就不客气了。\n谢谢你们两位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "e1a73e2e0509ba3592400f2d79a59b10c147df273ce2b3f0bac4acef8094ae76", "ja": "ううん、これくらい、とうぜんだよっ。わたしたち、\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演のなかまだもん！", "zh": "不会，这点小事是当然的。\n我们也是『Sunshine Rhythm!』公演的好伙伴嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "fc1f1de605a3d221a69899049d1e4b5d8758a87a1eea984d2e058b0408ffdfb0", "ja": "このおはぎ、とってもおいしいネ！\n甘すぎなくて、アンコもおいしいヨー♪", "zh": "这个萩饼非常好吃耶！\n不会太甜，豆沙又很美味喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "1c68590ccc80f4d0b8fca80792293e6071a708278bfd4594dfee65a5e6397322", "ja": "すごいねエミリーちゃん！　これならいっぱい\n食べられるね！　今度レシピ教えてもらえるかなっ？", "zh": "好厉害呀，艾蜜莉！这样再多都吃得下呢！\n下次可以告诉我食谱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "ceacaef8781bb8551f113329c117df2013f14146b9e83dab23bfd04ce782ee93", "ja": "はい、もちろんです♪\n今度、作り方をしたためておきますね。", "zh": "好的，当然没问题♪\n届时我会先整理好食谱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "fe240ac8a45347157153ba32c3ef86023d8ad77302b4073f57bee48aec8abff7", "ja": "ありがとうエミリーちゃん！　味も今のうちに\n覚えちゃおうっと。モグモグ……うん、おいしい♪", "zh": "谢谢你，艾蜜莉！我也趁现在先把味道记住吧。\n（嚼嚼……）嗯，好好吃♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3c4ddc2206f387b0caaf3716f249d0be6358a6b56bab959f002a559c43e8197d", "ja": "エネルギーの補填はいいけど、まだレッスン中だし。\nあんまり食べ過ぎないようにな？", "zh": "补充能量是没关系，不过现在还在训练，\n可不要吃太多喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "ea13d7c026d93dae7c31028d9234fbb9a2edb74efc2057c49e574d2b1d11ab13", "ja": "えへ、動いたぶんは、きっと食べてもへいきで～す♪\nおいしいおはぎで、元気もりもり～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，有在运动吃再多也一定没问题～♪\n吃美味的萩饼，活力百倍～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "418ace6f6d063607c62775905bd71fb6bde2072f8461c306fb129c0afba45d62", "ja": "そういえば可奈ちゃん、聞いたよ！\n最初、可奈ちゃんが今みたいに歌った歌が……", "zh": "话说可奈，我听说了喔！\n起初可奈就像刚刚那样即兴唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "a21b4d152774153a5ed2e59b102e40674f74dec695c3f92ecf3a3848ad8ad9ec", "ja": "『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』だって、\nみんな勘違いしちゃったって。", "zh": "结果被大家一阵误会，\n以为你唱的就是『阳光律动管弦乐♪』的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "0667677918346f6c24169de87a54fdf717b2e32cc4437bbbd2c25161652a1c0f", "ja": "私も聞きました。新曲と間違われてしまうなんて、\nとても見事な歌だったのですね！", "zh": "我也听说了，居然会被误认为新歌，\n想必是非常棒的歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "d1a69f56734162b375bf75f2497ede74d3353440c0cd07c3a54a449f9d5f3f6a", "ja": "ウン♪　もう一回歌ってほしいくらいだヨ♪", "zh": "嗯♪棒到都想听她再唱一次呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "ee952ed30ec02b7aab30e0ee4629043c374ffab2013add5d68713422adc3f5e4", "ja": "そ、そんなに上手だったかな～？\nえへへ、なんかハズかちいな～♪", "zh": "有、有那么好吗～？\n嘿嘿，总觉得有点害羞耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "9db313653b837bda36ef2141f3c407b47e04a614c750e0b1fdd7cb54fd5d7cb5", "ja": "可奈ちゃんの歌って、とってもおもしろいよね！\n聞いてると元気になるし、わたしもだいすき！", "zh": "可奈唱的歌都非常有趣呢！\n听着就会觉得充满活力，我也很喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "f4fa6ed4d14a3fd8b74077f6ac57b030bd3340767a0e1956fa0ca2ba7ccdeb39", "ja": "ン～、思いだしたら、またカナの歌でサンバを踊りたく\nなってきちゃったヨ♪　カナ、ミュージックスタート！", "zh": "嗯～一回想起来，又想配合可奈的歌来跳森巴了唷♪\n可奈，Music start！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "7b9da1d66bc9dfc4e053c2ecc2691c68792c1fa7382f16a3d8f93370e0d80963", "ja": "えっ、ホントに歌うんですか！？\nそ、それじゃあ……いきますね！", "zh": "咦，真的要唱吗！？\n那、那么……我要唱啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "69031ba039cd7eb15ec705b72619aa31d028249816d29cdbc51cfc1bf2df1315", "ja": "サーンサーン、サンリズムー♪\nオー、オーケストラ～♪", "zh": "阳光阳光、阳光律动♪\n管弦、管弦乐～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "dcb8a174c6c9790aefc903a0cc7e8c87963ed88d7ef05c965a0959f684ec5c0e", "ja": "アハッ、前とちょっと違うカモ！\nでも、その方が楽しいヨー♪", "zh": "啊哈，好像和之前有点不一样！\n不过这样也很有趣～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "4d6466651f189bf8dadefe378f24a8e1a5ae6589bc3c000a1da48b120b5fdab3", "ja": "そうだね！　好きなリズムを拾って、\n気分でリズムを、自由に……、合わせて……。", "zh": "对呀！选择自己喜欢的节奏，\n随着心情，自由……搭配节奏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "6c3d878db5a5126172b37cc4aa8f8ffa8dbd571f6d7020c0b8f0e9f6abf2c757", "ja": "そっか！　もしかしたら私……。\nダンスに足りないもの、わかった気がする！", "zh": "原来如此！我搞不好……\n明白我们的舞蹈还缺什么了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "a65d38a1d6b03754d75e3542883a03ac72da8dffe48f9dc69fab3a5a259a02e3", "ja": "えっ？　足りないものって……\nさっきの、塩気のことですか？", "zh": "咦？你说我们缺的……\n是指刚刚说的咸味吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "381a0bec07acd590e41291b42a3fc78f369d6c995b2c7216b10eb5c548eb1b5d", "ja": "そう、塩気が足りなかったんだよ！\n可奈ちゃんの歌みたいな塩気が！", "zh": "对，就是咸味不够呀！\n像可奈唱的歌这种咸味！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "3eeb11ea27e43b889d6513432ed1bffeb01f5d7d9717ed282a5cef0054186996", "ja": "えっ、私の歌が塩！？", "zh": "咦，我的歌是盐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1041_019min", "source_sha256": "3bd3150eed77bf64e315c1996897ed27b1872d776655d66437a21f22462b86a5", "ja": "つまり、可奈ちゃんの歌みたいな、\n自由さとか元気さが必要なんじゃないかなって！", "zh": "也就是说，就像可奈的歌一样，\n我们或许需要增添自由和活力的气息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1042_019min", "source_sha256": "15e629946bf899c7e548c7bf19f10ff31c102e3bafedf4035cfc29474eeba83f", "ja": "あの時、最初にみんなで踊ったサンバって、すっごく\nのびのび楽しめたよね？　決まり事もなくて。", "zh": "当时大家最早一起跳的森巴舞，\n非常自由自在且很开心对吧？也没什么规矩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1043_019min", "source_sha256": "f8b55121047f685bf50491b4626e1b0ecab6387442bbeedadde00fd57264a4e6", "ja": "あのサンバみたいな元気があると、「サンリズム・\nオーケストラ♪」は、もっと楽しくなると思って！", "zh": "我觉得只要像那支森巴一样充满活力，\n「阳光律动管弦乐♪」就会更加快乐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1044_018ele", "source_sha256": "aa42c6a3a298373262780edcf9273cfe0b2f032c0af77ccb28d0b9f4fd5284a7", "ja": "アハッ、サンバのオーケストラ、すごくステキだネ♪\n{$P$}、どうかナ？", "zh": "啊哈，跳森巴舞的管弦乐，听起来很棒呢♪\n{$P$}，你觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "d112b400432f829d1515de0bb546beae9db45406eaf8aaf6e3fad194dba2a976", "ja": "そうだな。今回のステージは、みんなに太陽みたいな\n喜びや、笑顔のオーケストラを感じてもらいたい……", "zh": "也对，这次的表演就是希望让大家感受到\n太阳般的喜悦，充满着笑容的管弦乐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1046_p", "source_sha256": "e114ca17bdf4f89f79e7fd134b0a9e76441c3eb59833b3e0caac3bdb59b567d4", "ja": "それには1人1人の、喜びを重ねないと。\n自由と元気は、俺も大事だと思うな。", "zh": "要做到这点就需要融合每个人的喜悦，\n我也觉得自由和活力很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "2dbe71a83669efb8296c4a5687b84a13c792e843619fd030c5d99385ec513e02", "ja": "でも……、仕掛け人さま？　舞の型をくずしては、\nよくないのではありませんか？", "zh": "可是……策划执行人先生？\n打散舞蹈架构，会不会不太好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1048_030iku", "source_sha256": "b3cae8f99d9e673cd5bf9dd47213080472b822fc57ea1f46767f9b8facbc38e6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nダンス、ちゃんと覚えなくていいの？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n不用好好记住舞蹈也没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "ff6686595eb5168f086ada51953116aed700b3325ea384a1318a4e63ab3bd16d", "ja": "ダンスはもちろん覚えてもらう。\nただ、気持ちを自由にしてもらいたいかな？", "zh": "舞蹈当然还是要记住，\n只是希望你们心情放得自由一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1050_036kan", "source_sha256": "244269592522ae91f1e56a6910c6d26251ab22639842c1dd9e3bdbd9fe63aa85", "ja": "気持ちを自由にして……？\nうう～ん、なんだか難しそうです……。", "zh": "心情放得自由一点……？\n唔嗯～听起来好像很困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1051_019min", "source_sha256": "1ad73926a3f8b37806a638bc0b4312ac1fdbbcc317d9b5730edd132fbe3f7d00", "ja": "可奈ちゃんは……思わず歌っちゃう時の気持ちで、\n覚えたダンスを踊ってみればいいのかも！", "zh": "可奈的话……应该可以用不禁随兴哼出歌曲的心情，\n试着去诠释记住的舞蹈喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1052_036kan", "source_sha256": "fe3e0827ba48baf3d985dc70df6fdbd676dc67b03820cc9e1892b1e5bc9506b3", "ja": "思わず歌っちゃうみたいに……。\nあ、なんだかわかる気がします！", "zh": "不禁随兴哼出歌曲的心情……\n啊，我好像有点明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1053_018ele", "source_sha256": "d170a91fbb0f41efe76e45e056aa95a4050b4f14408308a0ecdbc290d7d5e803", "ja": "じゃあ、今度は、『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』を\nサンバみたいにダンスしてみヨー♪", "zh": "那么，接下来就将『阳光律动管弦乐♪』\n跳得像森巴一样试试吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1054_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1055_030iku", "source_sha256": "edc7f3094baf0ae1b92fba27b6fd7d149f56185f56d28ad2f5b497519e45c5d8", "ja": "わぁ～！　すっごく元気なダンスだったね！\nみんな、ぜったいもりあがると思う！", "zh": "哇～！好有活力的舞蹈呢！\n我觉得大家一定会嗨起来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1056_032emi", "source_sha256": "48bdc93a9f8ca4324a1c746509e4e84f34c13b701d7e0602e1519b1746fe4fbf", "ja": "とっても律動的で、みなさん輝いて見えました！\n私も一緒に舞わせていただきたくて、うずうずと……♪", "zh": "非常有律动感，大家都好像散发着光芒！\n让我也忍不住想要和大家共舞……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1057_036kan", "source_sha256": "65bf6749ed80af1383f24224885d2fe7856eaf9a9ec867ab207749234c94edcc", "ja": "わぁ、大好評♪\nこれならいけるかも！", "zh": "哇，大受好评♪\n这样应该行得通喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1058_019min", "source_sha256": "a76ed745e5188a462b81dbd627dc1783f958be8dde1aa556d60c78dc86b35b9b", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……\nうんっ、手応え、あったかも！", "zh": "呼、呼……\n嗯，感觉比较得心应手了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1059_018ele", "source_sha256": "2ee700f4f61f8089f3deff180db05e404e8f6b224483942322df908e3d0e6419", "ja": "ツバサとヒナタも、きっと喜ぶヨ！\n帰ってきたらみんなで一緒に、レッツダンスだネ♪", "zh": "翼和日向一定也会很高兴的！\n回去之后就大家一起练习跳舞啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "0ad5a337f462be1a814b20245b2c1c5add8f0dfdbecb7bbe5c8a247300c7e93a", "ja": "（日頃のレッスンを欠かさないからこそ、小さな\nきっかけ1つが、大きな成長へと繋がっていく）", "zh": "（正因为有平日的扎实训练，\n才能从一点小契机获得更大的成长。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0048_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_05_1061_p", "source_sha256": "5bba3e673b4a209724100767f33535e7e9b393e4d108892ecbf9c19c15587b06", "ja": "（最初は小さかった太陽の輝き。\nそれが今、大きく広がり始めている……！）", "zh": "（一开始还很微弱的太阳光芒，\n现在就要开始变大了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
